  "content": "\n\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/wJgNb2w8/images/33468c96f882e0ba266b016cd1df944807fec4ea.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"643\"><br></span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;font-size:18px\">《Gray's Mob Overhaul》是一款受角色扮演遊戲（RPG）啟發的生物改裝包，為所有生物重新建模並提供多種自訂貼圖。</span></h2>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#f60;font-size:18px\">1.19 - 1.20</span></h3>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\">需要 OptiFine 或模組：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fentity-model-features\" rel=\"nofollow\">EMF</a> / <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fentitytexturefeatures\" rel=\"nofollow\">ETF</a></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span>使用模組？請在此查看村民<a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/grays-mob-overhaul-unofficial-compatibility-pack\" rel=\"nofollow\"> 模組支援外掛</a><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/grays-mob-overhaul-unofficial-compatibility-pack\" rel=\"nofollow\">！</a></span></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><br></span><span style=\"font-style:italic;font-size:16px\"><span style=\"font-style:italic;font-size:18px\">更多版本可於我的 </span><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/caninegray\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Patreon！</span></a></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><em><br></em></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><em>獨立包：</em></strong></span><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><br></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<div><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;font-style:italic\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252ftexture-pack%252fbetter-cat-breeds%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">更棒的貓！</a><br><br><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252ftexture-pack%252fdynamic-horses%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">更棒的馬</a><br><br></span><span style=\"font-weight:bold;font-style:italic\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252ftexture-pack%252fwild-wolves%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">野生狼</a><br><br></span><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252ftexture-pack%252fcozy-critters%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;font-style:italic\">舒適小動物</span></a></span></div>\n</div>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><em>&nbsp;</em></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><em>使用教學：</em></strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><strong>由於 OptiFine 的更新與功能支援較不穩定，建議改用以下模組：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fentity-model-features\" rel=\"nofollow\">EMF</a> 與 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fentitytexturefeatures\" rel=\"nofollow\">ETF</a></strong><br><br><strong><em>若使用 OptiFine，請確保啟用以下設定以獲得完整功能：</em></strong><br>影片設定 → 品質 → 自訂實體模型：開啟<br>隨機實體 → 開啟<br>發光貼圖 → 開啟<br><br>為避免貼圖顯示異常，《Gray's Mob Overhaul》應置於資源包列表的 <span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">最上方</span>。</p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><em><strong>授權條款</strong></em></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;font-style:italic\"><span style=\"color:#000\">本作品採用</span></span> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fcreativecommons.org%252flicenses%252fby-nc%252f4.0%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><em>創用 CC 姓名標示-非商業性 4.0 國際授權條款</em></a><em>。</em></span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#2fcc71\">歡迎：<br>-加入伺服器使用<br>-修改內容供個人使用<br>-分享並註明出處</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#e74c3c\">請勿：<br>-重新上傳或販售<br>-修改、複製設計或聲稱擁有版權<br>-未註明出處分享<br><br><span style=\"color:#000\">如有疑問，請私訊詢問授權</span></span></p>\n</div>",
